{"title":"49","section":"1305","heading":"Authorization of appropriations","lead":"There are authorized to be appropriated for the activities of the Board—","tree":[{"marker":"(1)","path":"(1)","heading":"","text":"$33,000,000 for fiscal year 2016;","children":[]},{"marker":"(2)","path":"(2)","heading":"","text":"$35,000,000 for fiscal year 2017;","children":[]},{"marker":"(3)","path":"(3)","heading":"","text":"$35,500,000 for fiscal year 2018;","children":[]},{"marker":"(4)","path":"(4)","heading":"","text":"$35,500,000 for fiscal year 2019; and","children":[]},{"marker":"(5)","path":"(5)","heading":"","text":"$36,000,000 for fiscal year 2020.","children":[]}],"notes":[{"topic":"editorialNotes","text":"Editorial Notes"},{"topic":"amendments","text":"Amendments2015—Pub. L. 114–110, § 3(a)(3), renumbered section 705 of this title as this section. Pars. (1) to (5). Pub. L. 114–110, § 7, added pars. (1) to (5) and struck out former pars. (1) to (3) which related to appropriations for fiscal years 1996, 1997, and 1998, respectively."}],"sourceCredit":"(Added Pub. L. 104–88, title II, § 201(a), Dec. 29, 1995, 109 Stat. 934, § 705; renumbered § 1305 and amended Pub. L. 114–110, §§ 3(a)(3), 7, Dec. 18, 2015, 129 Stat. 2228, 2232.)","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 49—","heading":"TRANSPORTATION","identifier":"/us/usc/t49"},{"type":"subtitle","num":"SUBTITLE II—","heading":"OTHER GOVERNMENT AGENCIES","identifier":"/us/usc/t49/stII"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 13—","heading":"SURFACE TRANSPORTATION BOARD","identifier":"/us/usc/t49/stII/ch13"},{"type":"subchapter","num":"SUBCHAPTER I—","heading":"ESTABLISHMENT","identifier":"/us/usc/t49/stII/ch13/schI"}]}